flowchart TB
    classDef ui fill:#E8F1FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#172554
    classDef api fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#022C22
    classDef domain fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#2E1065
    classDef data fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#475569,color:#0F172A
    classDef cross fill:#FEFCE8,stroke:#CA8A04,color:#422006

    UI[React / TanStack Router / TanStack Query<br/>生成式 TypeScript API Client]:::ui
    API[FastAPI app.main<br/>/api/v1 路由聚合]:::api
    Auth[登录、JWT、密码哈希]:::cross
    Permission[RBAC + user_plant_access<br/>管理员 / 工程师 / 观察者]:::cross
    Config[Pydantic Settings<br/>环境变量、白名单、存储与批大小]:::cross

    subgraph Routers[接口层]
        RUser[users / login]:::api
        RAsset[plants / production-lines<br/>devices / tags]:::api
        RImport[imports]:::api
        RAcquire[acquisition]:::api
        RUtils[utils / health]:::api
    end

    subgraph Domains[领域与应用服务]
        AssetDomain[资产层级、状态切换<br/>编码唯一性与范围校验]:::domain
        ImportReader[reader<br/>CSV/XLSX 流式读取、编码检测、预览]:::domain
        ImportProcessor[processor<br/>宽窄表标准化、质量校验、分块事务]:::domain
        OpcClient[opcua client / collector<br/>浏览、订阅、重连、写入]:::domain
        Simulator[opcua simulator<br/>可重复的本地工业信号]:::domain
    end

    subgraph Database[PostgreSQL 18：配置关系模型 + 窄表时序事实]
        U[(user)]:::data
        UA[(user_plant_access)]:::data
        P[(plant)]:::data
        L[(production_line)]:::data
        D[(device)]:::data
        T[(tag)]:::data
        AT[(acquisition_task)]:::data
        AN[(acquisition_node)]:::data
        IB[(import_batch<br/>mapping_config)]:::data
        IFM[(import_field_mapping)]:::data
        DQI[(data_quality_issue)]:::data
        TS[(tag_sample<br/>JSON value + numeric_value)]:::data
        RV[(v_tag_sample_readable)]:::data
    end

    UI --> API
    API --> Auth
    API --> Permission
    API --> Config
    API --> RUser
    API --> RAsset
    API --> RImport
    API --> RAcquire
    API --> RUtils
    RAsset --> AssetDomain
    RImport --> ImportReader --> ImportProcessor
    RAcquire --> OpcClient
    OpcClient --> Simulator

    U --> UA --> P
    P --> L --> D --> T
    P --> AT --> AN --> T
    P --> IB --> IFM
    IB --> DQI
    IB --> TS
    AT --> TS
    T --> TS --> RV
    AssetDomain --> P
    ImportProcessor --> IB
    ImportProcessor --> DQI
    ImportProcessor --> TS
    OpcClient --> AT
    OpcClient --> TS
